ction of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-2,2)$, $(-2,2),$ $(2,-2).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040372/assets/c688b1ee540e732329e597fb97a0595f619dbc4ff0aad86b6a01f1bdb51ae66b.png)" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307350 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307351 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307352 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307353 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307354 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1041 "selection" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307350 13194139534747 true] [17592186307349 1110 #uuid "d3aee704-3c44-51a1-b1a0-55744186f527" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307350 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040372/assets/c688b1ee540e732329e597fb97a0595f619dbc4ff0aad86b6a01f1bdb51ae66b.png" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307350 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534747 true] [17592186307350 1111 #uuid "a60886ab-a9e4-5c51-8ce4-015666d95c02" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307351 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040372/assets/8f43f19bbe4213ba2f9d5bc51f52b747e1c7840a27607207f0ca56021c1914d5.png" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307351 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534747 true] [17592186307351 1111 #uuid 