rtices of ${S}^{′}$ are  $(-2,4)$, and $(1,-2).$ \n\nSo, the correct answer is \" II only.\"" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307378 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307379 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307380 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307381 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1000 #edb/ref 17592186307382 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1041 "selection" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1104 #edb/ref 17592186307382 13194139534747 true] [17592186307377 1110 #uuid "aa4a3859-985b-54af-b2f1-ecb0b3eb0cb5" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307378 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307378 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534747 true] [17592186307378 1111 #uuid "90c88263-67ad-5b92-a0f3-90331ef7eb5a" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307379 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307379 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534747 true] [17592186307379 1111 #uuid "6bfb653d-877d-5d5b-a53c-869a8bd060d0" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307380 1034 "I only" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307380 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534747 true] [17592186307380 1111 #uuid "dc18865f-c3ea-51c9-bb18-0a82b54c29f1" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307381 1034 "III only" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307381 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534747 true] [17592186307381 1111 #uuid "170bc223-b505-5cb8-bbc7-4771033478bc" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307382 1034 "II only" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307382 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534747 true] [17592186307382 1111 #uuid "c826b540-a50c-57cf-9a12-04772e252dbe" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307383 1017 #edb/ref 17592186307384 13194139534747 true] [17592186307383 1089 "q-97022" 13194139534747 true] [17592186307383 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534747 true] [17592186307383 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Acad